	"Name": "Kenneth's Witch Garden Roses",
	"Author": "Kf29",
	"Description": "[size=4][b]Kenneth's Witch Garden Roses - Content Patcher[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]This mod adds 9 new garden roses: Amber, Blood, Blush, Ebony, Frost, Ivory, Mystic, Ocean and Sunshine Garden Rose.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]All roses are regrowable and seasonal. They grow in spring, summer, fall and winter depending on the variety.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Each rose can be brewed into a rose potion.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Seeds are sold at Kenneth's Seed Shop.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Rose potions are sold at Kenneth's Drink Shop.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]All potions can also be cooked with cooking recipes.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]This mod is balanced for vanilla gameplay and designed to fit naturally into the game. The roses work as flowers and as gift items.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Credits:[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Sprites and art assets by Lavliette, used with permission.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Content Patcher conversion by Kf.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Original Mod: https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/14999[/b][/size]",
	"PageUrl": "https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/52651",
